{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-testing","title":"策略测试与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/policy-testing","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"策略测试与验证\">策略测试与验证</h1><p>策略即代码将治理规则转化为可执行代码，这意味着策略本身也需要像应用代码一样被测试和验证。未经测试的策略可能导致两种严重后果：该拦截的违规没有被拦截（漏报），或者正常的操作被错误地阻止（误报）。本章讲解策略测试的方法论、工具链和最佳实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"为什么策略测试至关重要\">为什么策略测试至关重要</h2><p>策略代码的缺陷比普通应用代码的缺陷影响更广泛，因为它作用于整个系统的治理层面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 策略缺陷的影响&#10;        U1[漏报 False Negative] --&gt; C1[违规资源进入生产]&#10;        C1 --&gt; C1a[安全漏洞]&#10;        C1 --&gt; C1b[合规风险]&#10;        U2[误报 False Positive] --&gt; C2[正常部署被阻止]&#10;        C2 --&gt; C2a[交付速度下降]&#10;        C2 --&gt; C2b[开发者信任度降低]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 策略缺陷的影响\n        U1[漏报 False Negative] --&gt; C1[违规资源进入生产]\n        C1 --&gt; C1a[安全漏洞]\n        C1 --&gt; C1b[合规风险]\n        U2[误报 False Positive] --&gt; C2[正常部署被阻止]\n        C2 --&gt; C2a[交付速度下降]\n        C2 --&gt; C2b[开发者信任度降低]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>影响程度</th>\n<th>检测难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漏报（False Negative）</td>\n<td>应该拒绝的请求被允许</td>\n<td>高（安全/合规风险）</td>\n<td>较难（需要全面的负向测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报（False Positive）</td>\n<td>应该允许的请求被拒绝</td>\n<td>中（影响效率和信任）</td>\n<td>较易（正向测试可覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略冲突</td>\n<td>多条策略结果矛盾</td>\n<td>中（行为不可预测）</td>\n<td>中等（需要集成测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能退化</td>\n<td>策略评估超时或资源消耗过高</td>\n<td>高（影响系统可用性）</td>\n<td>较难（需要性能测试）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>策略测试的核心目标：</strong> 确保每条策略在预期的输入下产生预期的输出，并且不会产生意外的副作用。这包括验证&quot;该通过的确实通过&quot;和&quot;该拒绝的确实被拒绝&quot;两个方向。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试金字塔\">测试金字塔</h2><p>策略测试遵循与应用测试类似的金字塔模型，但各层的具体内容有所不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E2E[端到端测试&lt;br/&gt;完整流水线集成] --&gt; INT[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;多策略协同]&#10;    INT --&gt; UNIT[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;单条策略]&#10;    UNIT --&gt; LINT[静态检查&lt;br/&gt;语法/风格/最佳实践]\">graph TD\n    E2E[端到端测试&lt;br/&gt;完整流水线集成] --&gt; INT[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;多策略协同]\n    INT --&gt; UNIT[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;单条策略]\n    UNIT --&gt; LINT[静态检查&lt;br/&gt;语法/风格/最佳实践]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层级</th>\n<th>测试对象</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>执行频率</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态检查</td>\n<td>策略语法和风格</td>\n<td>regal、opa check</td>\n<td>每次保存</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>单条策略的输入输出</td>\n<td>opa test、kyverno test</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>多策略组合和真实输入</td>\n<td>opa test + 真实数据</td>\n<td>每次合并</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端测试</td>\n<td>完整 CI/CD 流水线</td>\n<td>实际流水线运行</td>\n<td>每日/每周</td>\n<td>十分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"静态检查\">静态检查</h2><p>静态检查在不运行策略的情况下分析代码质量，是最快的反馈循环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"regal-rego-lint-工具\">Regal：Rego Lint 工具</h3><p>Regal 是 OPA 生态中最流行的 Rego 代码 Lint 工具，内置超过 100 条最佳实践规则。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Regal&#10;brew install styrainc/packages/regal&#10;# 或下载二进制&#10;curl -L https://github.com/StyraInc/regal/releases/download/v0.28.0/regal_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz&#10;&#10;# 检查策略代码&#10;regal lint policy/&#10;&#10;# 输出 JSON 格式（用于 CI 集成）&#10;regal lint policy/ --format=json&#10;&#10;# 自定义规则配置&#10;# .regal/config.yaml&#10;# rules:&#10;#   style:&#10;#     directory-package-mismatch: ignore&#10;#   bugs:&#10;#     not-equals-in-loop: error\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Regal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> styrainc/packages/regal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或下载二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/StyraInc/regal/releases/download/v0.28.0/regal_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查策略代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regal</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 JSON 格式（用于 CI 集成）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regal</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自定义规则配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .regal/config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rules:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   style:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     directory-package-mismatch: ignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   bugs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     not-equals-in-loop: error</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"opa-check\">opa check</h3><p>OPA 内置的语法检查工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检查策略语法&#10;opa check policy/&#10;&#10;# 检查并输出详细错误&#10;opa check policy/ --format=pretty\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查策略语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查并输出详细错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=pretty</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见静态检查规则\">常见静态检查规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查类型</th>\n<th>规则示例</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法错误</td>\n<td>未闭合的括号、无效关键字</td>\n<td>error</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未使用变量</td>\n<td>定义了但未使用的变量</td>\n<td>warning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名规范</td>\n<td>规则名使用 snake_case</td>\n<td>style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免 <code>!=</code></td>\n<td>循环中使用 <code>!=</code> 可能导致逻辑错误</td>\n<td>bug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>禁止硬编码</td>\n<td>策略中硬编码的密钥或 IP</td>\n<td>security</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试\">单元测试</h2><p>单元测试是策略测试的核心，验证单条策略在给定输入下是否产生预期输出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"opa-测试框架\">OPA 测试框架</h3><p>OPA 内置了完整的测试框架，测试文件以 <code>_test.rego</code> 结尾。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# admission_test.rego&#10;package kubernetes.admission&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;&#10;# 正向测试：合法 Pod 应被允许&#10;test_allow_valid_pod if {&#10;    result := allow with input as valid_pod_input&#10;    result == true&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 反向测试：使用 latest 标签的 Pod 应被拒绝&#10;test_deny_latest_tag if {&#10;    result := allow with input as latest_tag_input&#10;    result == false&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 违规消息测试：验证具体的违规信息&#10;test_violation_message_latest_tag if {&#10;    result := violations with input as latest_tag_input&#10;    count(result) &gt; 0&#10;    msg := result[_]&#10;    contains(msg, &quot;latest&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 边界测试：空容器列表&#10;test_allow_empty_containers if {&#10;    result := allow with input as empty_containers_input&#10;    result == true&#10;}&#10;&#10;# --- 测试数据 ---&#10;&#10;valid_pod_input := {&#10;    &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;kind&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;Pod&quot;},&#10;        &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;CREATE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;object&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;spec&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;containers&quot;: [&#10;                    {&#10;                        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app&quot;,&#10;                        &quot;image&quot;: &quot;registry.example.com/app:v1.0.0&quot;,&#10;                        &quot;resources&quot;: {&#10;                            &quot;limits&quot;: {&quot;memory&quot;: &quot;512Mi&quot;, &quot;cpu&quot;: &quot;500m&quot;}&#10;                        }&#10;                    }&#10;                ]&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;latest_tag_input := {&#10;    &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;kind&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;Pod&quot;},&#10;        &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;CREATE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;object&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;spec&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;containers&quot;: [&#10;                    {&#10;                        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app&quot;,&#10;                        &quot;image&quot;: &quot;myapp:latest&quot;,&#10;                        &quot;resources&quot;: {&quot;limits&quot;: {&quot;memory&quot;: &quot;256Mi&quot;}}&#10;                    }&#10;                ]&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;empty_containers_input := {&#10;    &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;kind&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;Pod&quot;},&#10;        &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;CREATE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;object&quot;: {&quot;spec&quot;: {&quot;containers&quot;: []}}&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># admission_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 正向测试：合法 Pod 应被允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_allow_valid_pod if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as valid_pod_input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 反向测试：使用 latest 标签的 Pod 应被拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_deny_latest_tag if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as latest_tag_input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 违规消息测试：验证具体的违规信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_violation_message_latest_tag if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := violations with input as latest_tag_input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(result) > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := result[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(msg, \"latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 边界测试：空容器列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_allow_empty_containers if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as empty_containers_input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># --- 测试数据 ---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>valid_pod_input := {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"request\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"kind\": {\"kind\": \"Pod\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"operation\": \"CREATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"object\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"spec\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"containers\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"name\": \"app\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"image\": \"registry.example.com/app:v1.0.0\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"resources\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"limits\": {\"memory\": \"512Mi\", \"cpu\": \"500m\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>latest_tag_input := {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"request\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"kind\": {\"kind\": \"Pod\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"operation\": \"CREATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"object\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"spec\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"containers\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"name\": \"app\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"image\": \"myapp:latest\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"resources\": {\"limits\": {\"memory\": \"256Mi\"}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>empty_containers_input := {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"request\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"kind\": {\"kind\": \"Pod\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"operation\": \"CREATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"object\": {\"spec\": {\"containers\": []}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试数据组织\">测试数据组织</h3><p>对于复杂的测试场景，将测试数据分离到独立的 JSON 文件中更易于管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"policy/&#10;├── admission.rego&#10;├── admission_test.rego&#10;└── testdata/&#10;    ├── valid/&#10;    │   ├── pod_with_limits.json&#10;    │   ├── pod_with_trusted_image.json&#10;    │   └── pod_with_labels.json&#10;    └── invalid/&#10;        ├── pod_latest_tag.json&#10;        ├── pod_no_limits.json&#10;        ├── pod_privileged.json&#10;        └── pod_no_labels.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── admission.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── admission_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── testdata/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── valid/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── pod_with_limits.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── pod_with_trusted_image.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── pod_with_labels.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── invalid/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── pod_latest_tag.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── pod_no_limits.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── pod_privileged.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── pod_no_labels.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在测试中引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"test_deny_privileged_container if {&#10;    result := allow with input as data.testdata.invalid.pod_privileged&#10;    result == false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>test_deny_privileged_container if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as data.testdata.invalid.pod_privileged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"kyverno-策略测试\">Kyverno 策略测试</h3><p>Kyverno 提供了专门的 CLI 测试工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行 Kyverno 策略测试&#10;kyverno test policy/kyverno/&#10;&#10;# 测试文件结构（kyverno-test.yaml）&#10;# name: require-resource-limits tests&#10;# policies:&#10;#   - require-resource-limits.yaml&#10;# resources:&#10;#   - valid_pod.yaml&#10;#   - invalid_pod_no_limits.yaml&#10;# results:&#10;#   - policy: require-resource-limits&#10;#     rule: check-memory-limits&#10;#     resource: valid_pod&#10;#     kind: Pod&#10;#     result: pass&#10;#   - policy: require-resource-limits&#10;#     rule: check-memory-limits&#10;#     resource: invalid_pod_no_limits&#10;#     kind: Pod&#10;#     result: fail\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 Kyverno 策略测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kyverno</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/kyverno/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 测试文件结构（kyverno-test.yaml）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># name: require-resource-limits tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># policies:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - require-resource-limits.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># resources:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - valid_pod.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - invalid_pod_no_limits.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - policy: require-resource-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     rule: check-memory-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     resource: valid_pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     kind: Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     result: pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - policy: require-resource-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     rule: check-memory-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     resource: invalid_pod_no_limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     kind: Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     result: fail</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试\">集成测试</h2><p>集成测试验证多条策略协同工作时的行为，以及策略与真实数据的兼容性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测试策略组合\">测试策略组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# integration_test.rego&#10;package integration&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;&#10;# 测试所有策略同时评估时的行为&#10;test_all_policies_no_conflict if {&#10;    # 同时加载所有策略包&#10;    results := {&#10;        &quot;admission&quot;: data.kubernetes.admission.allow,&#10;        &quot;network&quot;: data.kubernetes.network.allow,&#10;        &quot;security&quot;: data.kubernetes.security.allow&#10;    } with input as real_world_pod&#10;&#10;    # 验证：不应该出现 admission 允许但 security 拒绝的矛盾&#10;    not (results.admission == true and results.security == false)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 测试策略优先级&#10;test_policy_priority if {&#10;    # 豁免策略应该覆盖通用拒绝策略&#10;    result := data.kubernetes.admission.allow with input as exempted_pod&#10;    result == true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># integration_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package integration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 测试所有策略同时评估时的行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_all_policies_no_conflict if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 同时加载所有策略包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    results := {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"admission\": data.kubernetes.admission.allow,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"network\": data.kubernetes.network.allow,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"security\": data.kubernetes.security.allow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } with input as real_world_pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 验证：不应该出现 admission 允许但 security 拒绝的矛盾</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not (results.admission == true and results.security == false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 测试策略优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_policy_priority if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 豁免策略应该覆盖通用拒绝策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := data.kubernetes.admission.allow with input as exempted_pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用真实数据测试\">使用真实数据测试</h3><p>从生产环境中采样真实的资源配置作为测试输入，确保策略在真实场景下表现正确。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 导出生产环境的 Pod 配置作为测试数据&#10;kubectl get pods -n production -o json &gt; testdata/production_pods.json&#10;&#10;# 运行策略评估，检查是否有意外拒绝&#10;opa eval -d policy/ -i testdata/production_pods.json \\&#10;  &quot;data.kubernetes.admission.violations&quot; \\&#10;  --format=pretty\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导出生产环境的 Pod 配置作为测试数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> testdata/production_pods.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行策略评估，检查是否有意外拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> testdata/production_pods.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"data.kubernetes.admission.violations\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --format=pretty</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖率度量\">覆盖率度量</h2><p>测试覆盖率是衡量策略测试完备性的重要指标。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成 OPA 测试覆盖率报告&#10;opa test policy/ --coverage --format=json &gt; coverage.json&#10;&#10;# 查看覆盖率摘要&#10;cat coverage.json | jq &#39;{coverage: .coverage, files: [.files[] | {file: .file, covered: .covered_lines, total: .total_lines}]}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成 OPA 测试覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --coverage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看覆盖率摘要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage.json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{coverage: .coverage, files: [.files[] | {file: .file, covered: .covered_lines, total: .total_lines}]}'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>覆盖率指标</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行覆盖率</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>策略代码行被测试执行的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则覆盖率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>每条规则至少有一个测试用例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正向覆盖率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>每条规则有&quot;应通过&quot;的测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向覆盖率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>每条规则有&quot;应拒绝&quot;的测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>覆盖率不是万能的：</strong> 高覆盖率不代表测试质量高。一条策略可能被测试执行了，但测试用例的输入可能没有覆盖关键的边界条件。覆盖率是必要但不充分的条件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试驱动的策略开发\">测试驱动的策略开发</h2><p>采用测试驱动开发（TDD）的方式编写策略，可以显著提高策略质量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    R[编写失败测试&lt;br/&gt;定义期望行为] --&gt; W[编写策略代码&lt;br/&gt;使测试通过]&#10;    W --&gt; R2[运行测试&lt;br/&gt;验证通过]&#10;    R2 --&gt; R3[重构策略&lt;br/&gt;保持测试通过]&#10;    R3 --&gt; R\">graph LR\n    R[编写失败测试&lt;br/&gt;定义期望行为] --&gt; W[编写策略代码&lt;br/&gt;使测试通过]\n    W --&gt; R2[运行测试&lt;br/&gt;验证通过]\n    R2 --&gt; R3[重构策略&lt;br/&gt;保持测试通过]\n    R3 --&gt; R</pre><p>TDD 策略开发的步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>写测试：</strong> 先写一个描述期望行为的测试（如&quot;缺少内存限制的 Pod 应被拒绝&quot;），此时测试会失败</li>\n<li><strong>写策略：</strong> 编写最少的策略代码使测试通过</li>\n<li><strong>验证：</strong> 运行所有测试确保新测试通过且旧测试仍然通过</li>\n<li><strong>重构：</strong> 优化策略代码结构，保持测试全部通过</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种方法确保了每条策略都有对应的测试覆盖，并且策略的行为是明确且可验证的。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"策略验证的自动化\">策略验证的自动化</h2><p>将策略测试集成到开发工作流中，确保每次变更都经过验证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[开发者本地] --&gt; |pre-commit| L[静态检查]&#10;    L --&gt; |git push| CI[CI 流水线]&#10;    CI --&gt; T1[单元测试]&#10;    T1 --&gt; T2[集成测试]&#10;    T2 --&gt; T3[覆盖率检查]&#10;    T3 --&gt; |全部通过| PR[PR 可合并]&#10;    T3 --&gt; |有失败| F[报告失败&lt;br/&gt;阻止合并]\">graph TD\n    D[开发者本地] --&gt; |pre-commit| L[静态检查]\n    L --&gt; |git push| CI[CI 流水线]\n    CI --&gt; T1[单元测试]\n    T1 --&gt; T2[集成测试]\n    T2 --&gt; T3[覆盖率检查]\n    T3 --&gt; |全部通过| PR[PR 可合并]\n    T3 --&gt; |有失败| F[报告失败&lt;br/&gt;阻止合并]</pre><h3 id=\"pre-commit-配置\">Pre-commit 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .pre-commit-config.yaml&#10;repos:&#10;  - repo: local&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: opa-check&#10;        name: OPA Syntax Check&#10;        entry: opa check policy/&#10;        language: system&#10;        files: \\.rego$&#10;      - id: opa-test&#10;        name: OPA Unit Tests&#10;        entry: opa test policy/&#10;        language: system&#10;        files: \\.rego$\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .pre-commit-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opa-check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OPA Syntax Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opa check policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\.rego$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opa-test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OPA Unit Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opa test policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\.rego$</span></span></code></pre></div><p>策略测试是策略质量保障的第一道防线。要让策略在组织中持续有效运行，还需要建立完善的<a href=\"policy-lifecycle\">策略生命周期管理</a>流程。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((策略测试与验证))&#10;    测试风险&#10;      漏报 False Negative&#10;      误报 False Positive&#10;      策略冲突&#10;      性能退化&#10;    测试金字塔&#10;      静态检查&#10;      单元测试&#10;      集成测试&#10;      端到端测试&#10;    工具链&#10;      regal Lint&#10;      opa test&#10;      kyverno test&#10;      覆盖率报告&#10;    测试数据&#10;      testdata 目录&#10;      真实数据采样&#10;      正向/反向用例&#10;    TDD 方法&#10;      先写失败测试&#10;      写策略使通过&#10;      重构保持通过&#10;    自动化&#10;      Pre-commit&#10;      CI 流水线&#10;      覆盖率门禁\">mindmap\n  root((策略测试与验证))\n    测试风险\n      漏报 False Negative\n      误报 False Positive\n      策略冲突\n      性能退化\n    测试金字塔\n      静态检查\n      单元测试\n      集成测试\n      端到端测试\n    工具链\n      regal Lint\n      opa test\n      kyverno test\n      覆盖率报告\n    测试数据\n      testdata 目录\n      真实数据采样\n      正向/反向用例\n    TDD 方法\n      先写失败测试\n      写策略使通过\n      重构保持通过\n    自动化\n      Pre-commit\n      CI 流水线\n      覆盖率门禁</pre><ul>\n<li>策略测试需要同时防范漏报（安全风险）和误报（信任损失），两个方向的测试都不可缺少。</li>\n<li>策略测试金字塔：静态检查（最快）→ 单元测试（核心）→ 集成测试（协同）→ 端到端测试（完整）。</li>\n<li>OPA 内置测试框架通过 <code>_test.rego</code> 文件和 <code>opa test</code> 命令提供完整的单元测试能力，支持覆盖率报告。</li>\n<li>测试数据应与测试逻辑分离，使用 <code>testdata/</code> 目录管理，并包含正向和反向用例。</li>\n<li>测试驱动开发（先写测试再写策略）是提高策略质量的有效方法论。</li>\n<li>将静态检查和单元测试集成到 Pre-commit 和 CI 流水线中，实现自动化的策略质量门禁。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略测试与验证","id":"策略测试与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么策略测试至关重要","id":"为什么策略测试至关重要"},{"level":2,"text":"测试金字塔","id":"测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"静态检查","id":"静态检查"},{"level":3,"text":"Regal：Rego Lint 工具","id":"regal-rego-lint-工具"},{"level":3,"text":"opa check","id":"opa-check"},{"level":3,"text":"常见静态检查规则","id":"常见静态检查规则"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试","id":"单元测试"},{"level":3,"text":"OPA 测试框架","id":"opa-测试框架"},{"level":3,"text":"测试数据组织","id":"测试数据组织"},{"level":3,"text":"Kyverno 策略测试","id":"kyverno-策略测试"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试","id":"集成测试"},{"level":3,"text":"测试策略组合","id":"测试策略组合"},{"level":3,"text":"使用真实数据测试","id":"使用真实数据测试"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖率度量","id":"覆盖率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"测试驱动的策略开发","id":"测试驱动的策略开发"},{"level":2,"text":"策略验证的自动化","id":"策略验证的自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"Pre-commit 配置","id":"pre-commit-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI/CD 策略门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/ci-cd-policy-gates"},"next":{"title":"策略生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/policy-lifecycle"}}